# .graphifyignore — Node / TypeScript backend (code graph carve-out)
#
# Copied into the repo checkout at build time from the VAULT-side copy at
# graphify/<repo>/.graphifyignore, which is the reviewable, committed one.
# PURE DENYLIST — never add a `!negation` line; negation is not available here.
#
# Scope for this stack is `src/` per package, which in a monorepo means "the
# workspace root MINUS this file" — hub-packages keeps its source under
# contracts/src, nest-common/src, nest-logger/src and a single positional root
# cannot express that. 58% of that mirror's nodes were out of scope before this.
#
# Keep the manifest/test-scaffolding block in step with:
#   node "${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/bin/scope-audit.mjs" --print-denylist

